は甘える系。恥ずかしがりながらも、自分でお強請りしちゃうタイプです。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「他の二人みたいに馴れ馴れしくする気はないからはっきり言っておくわ。あなたのことが大好きよ。それだけだからっ。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58071"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"76 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17539","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"c","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17539","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"153 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17539","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17539","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17539","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7bfcf1a04050690dcba2c64350b113424346e51cf8117c42271658212de41809.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9b2014f2b14352de357f6c1d04967119af97bbbae0b9047bc44c298c1ac2ac3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"風花ましろ","creatorId":"vndb:s5762","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5762","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5762","name":"中野 純花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:226259:58071:20833:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c64512","characterName":"猫屋 虎雛","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"58070","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"226259"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17541"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64512"},"originalCharacterName":"猫屋 虎雛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は子供っぽいところはありますが素直で真っ直ぐ。いつも、主人公をぐいぐい引っ張っていきます。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17541","sourceWorkId":"25906","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長：160cm B87（E） / W59 / H85"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好物：鰊ソバの鰊"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年上、お姉さん系の容姿で色っぽさは一番。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間に生まれ変わったことはなく、さらにあまり興味もなかった様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その為、猫的な「いつでもどこでもエッチ」「ハーレムとか常識」などの考えをもっておりいつも暴走気味。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は子供っぽいところはありますが素直で真っ直ぐ。いつも、主人公をぐいぐい引っ張っていきます。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事は一切できません。むしろさせると危険です。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチは非常識系。野外が多めです。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「人間って何かと不便なんだもん。でも、手を繋ぐって嬉しいね。それから、キスも好きかな？えへへ。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58070"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17541","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"e","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17541","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17541","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17541","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17541","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/6200efab66ac46f6e7f9ad8329b3ded4fd5ae2753527385b59188e0bbe9c5382.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d6def01f516a626c7a660806ed22505159bf287087ac155f2b866f091826fd10.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朝比奈幸","creatorId":"vndb:s21648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21648","name":"朝比奈 幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:226259:58070:17080:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"綾音 まこ","creatorId":"vndb:s2581","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2581","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2581","name":"綾音 まこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:75720","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c64513","characterName":"猫畑 美也日","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"58069","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"226259"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17540"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64513"},"originalCharacterName":"猫畑 美也日","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"仔ネコ時代の飼い主が優しい人間だったらしく、人間にずっと憧れを抱いていました。なので、人間については勉強済み……のハズですが、いろいろ勘違いしています（お風呂でローションを作ったり、朝はお口でご奉仕など……教材がエッチ系）"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17540","sourceWorkId":"25906","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長：158cm B90（G） / W60 / H87"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好物：カツサンド（牛）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとり系のお姉さんタイプ。タレ目でやさしい雰囲気。胸は一番大きめ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他人を甘やかすことに生き甲斐を感じている世話焼きタイプです。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仔ネコ時代の飼い主が優しい人間だったらしく、人間にずっと憧れを抱いていました。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なので、人間のについては勉強済み……のハズですが、いろいろ勘違いしています（お風呂でローションを作ったり、朝はお口でご奉仕など……教材がエッチ系）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事は得意ですが、彼女が料理当番をすると食材の消費量が二倍になります（大食いです）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチはご奉仕系。何でもしてあげたいって言うタイプです。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「人間にはずっと憧れていたんです。美味しそうな食べ物、暖かそうなベッド。それに素敵な恋愛もっ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58069"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17540","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17540","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17540","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17540","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17540","sourceWorkId":"25906","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9ce379672207e555a3b295d37d1fdd24101c71305ba97b8079100274290dfd82.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/55ac339fe61a3cfd59179604f8780dc296f3a31579e64c5c87c4eb44075b437c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北村彩","creatorId":"vndb:s912","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s912","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s912","name":"北村 彩","roleCode